4,86,23],[33652,28.1,1985,67,86,25]],"links":[["Spokane County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/washington/spokane-county"],["ARC or PLC in Spokane County","/arc-plc/washington/spokane-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 15 grids in Spokane County came in under 90% of normal in August to September in 40 of 75 years since 1951, and in July to August in 39. In 2025, June to July came in at 18% of normal on the middle of the grids, and in 2026 so far the same pair sits at 25%. November to December is the wettest pair at 5.11 inches, and July to August is the driest at 1.36. Grid 32749 had its driest year in 1976 at 67%.</p>"}
